# Alacritty Project Structure Guide

## Main Entry Points
- [alacritty/src/main.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/main.rs) - Main application entry point
- [alacritty/src/window_context.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/window_context.rs) - Window and tab management context
- [alacritty/src/event.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/event.rs) - Event handling and action processing

## Core Modules

### Terminal Management
- [alacritty_terminal/](mdc:alacritty_terminal/) - Core terminal emulation library
- [alacritty_terminal/src/term/mod.rs](mdc:alacritty_terminal/src/term/mod.rs) - Terminal state and operations
- [alacritty_terminal/src/grid/](mdc:alacritty_terminal/src/grid/) - Terminal grid data structures

### Display System
- [alacritty/src/display/mod.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/display/mod.rs) - Main display logic and rendering
- [alacritty/src/display/content.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/display/content.rs) - Terminal content rendering
- [alacritty/src/renderer/](mdc:alacritty/src/renderer/) - OpenGL rendering system

### Configuration
- [alacritty_config/](mdc:alacritty_config/) - Configuration parsing and validation
- [alacritty_config_derive/](mdc:alacritty_config_derive/) - Derive macros for configuration
- [alacritty/src/config/](mdc:alacritty/src/config/) - Configuration structures and defaults

### Input Handling
- [alacritty/src/input/mod.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/input/mod.rs) - Input processing and key bindings
- [alacritty/src/input/keyboard.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/input/keyboard.rs) - Keyboard input handling

## Platform-Specific Code

### Linux
- Tab management in [alacritty/src/window_context.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/window_context.rs)
- Tab rendering in [alacritty/src/display/mod.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/display/mod.rs)
- Tab input handling in [alacritty/src/input/mod.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/input/mod.rs)

### macOS
- Native window tabbing in [alacritty/src/macos/](mdc:alacritty/src/macos/)
- Platform-specific locale handling

### Windows
- Windows-specific TTY handling in [alacritty_terminal/src/tty/windows/](mdc:alacritty_terminal/src/tty/windows/)

## Key Data Structures

### Tab Management (Linux)
```rust
pub struct TabManager {
    pub tabs: Vec<TabInfo>,
    pub active_tab: usize,
}

pub struct TabInfo {
    pub terminal: Arc<FairMutex<Term<EventProxy>>>,
    pub title: String,
    pub master_fd: RawFd,
    pub shell_pid: u32,
}
```

### Window Context
```rust
pub struct WindowContext {
    pub display: Display,
    pub message_buffer: MessageBuffer,
    pub dirty: bool,
    // Platform-specific terminal management
    #[cfg(target_os = "linux")]
    tab_manager: TabManager,
    #[cfg(not(target_os = "linux"))]
    terminal: Arc<FairMutex<Term<EventProxy>>>,
}
```

## Build System
- [Cargo.toml](mdc:Cargo.toml) - Main workspace configuration
- [alacritty/Cargo.toml](mdc:alacritty/Cargo.toml) - Main binary crate
- [Makefile](mdc:Makefile) - Build automation and testing

## Resources
- [alacritty/res/](mdc:alacritty/res/) - Shader files and resources
- [extra/](mdc:extra/) - Documentation, completions, and assets
- [docs/](mdc:docs/) - Project documentation

## Development Workflow
1. **Configuration changes**: Modify files in [alacritty/src/config/](mdc:alacritty/src/config/)
2. **Display changes**: Update [alacritty/src/display/mod.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/display/mod.rs)
3. **Input handling**: Modify [alacritty/src/input/mod.rs](mdc:alacritty/src/input/mod.rs)
4. **Terminal logic**: Update [alacritty_terminal/](mdc:alacritty_terminal/) crate
5. **Platform-specific**: Use appropriate `#[cfg()]` attributes

## Testing
- Unit tests in `#[cfg(test)]` modules
- Integration tests in [alacritty_terminal/tests/](mdc:alacritty_terminal/tests/)
- Reference tests in [alacritty_terminal/tests/ref/](mdc:alacritty_terminal/tests/ref/)

## Common Build Commands
```bash
cargo check          # Quick compilation check
cargo build          # Debug build
cargo build --release # Optimized build
cargo test           # Run tests
```